        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(gateway): skip secrets.resolve for active exec target SecretRefs (#96653)",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Skip `secrets.resolve` when **active** command target SecretRefs use `exec` providers, resolving them locally instead.\n- Stops per-reply gateway `UNAVAILABLE` log noise when model-provider credentials are exec-backed but gateway credentials are plaintext.\n\nFixes #96653\n\n## Root cause\n\n`resolveCommandSecretRefsViaGateway` only skipped gateway RPC for exec refs on the four gateway credential paths. Active model-provider exec refs still hit the gateway every turn, failed with `UNAVAILABLE`, then fell back locally.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm exec vitest run src/cli/command-secret-gateway.test.ts` (36 passed)\n- [x] Active exec target → gateway skipped, exec resolves locally\n- [x] Active env target + inactive exec target → gateway still called\n- [x] Existing gateway-credential exec skip path unchanged\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
